RELEVANT EXPERIENCE:
- Senior Product Owner at TechCorp (2020-2023)
  * Expertise in business analysis, product owner, requirements gathering, uml, bpmn
  * Led projects using agile, scrum, kanban, safe, sdlc
  * 5+ years experience in all required technologies
