Test Automation Engineer with 2+ year of experience.



Skills:

General programming: OOP, C#/.NET, base Java, base JavaScript;

IDE: Visual Studio 2019/2022, Rider, ReSharper;

Databases: MS SQL Server;

Framework: SpecFlow, Selenium, NUnit;

Version control: Git, Bitbucket, SourceTree;

Web API: Postman, Swagger;

Other: Jira, TeamCity, Jenkins, Slack, Allure, Regular expressions, RestSharp;



Typical responsibilities:

Maintain and improve automation framework;

Design, develop and maintain automated tests (UI/API);

Create and configure CI test runs;

Test analysis and stabilization by run reports;

Support manual testing team;

Create and support test documentation;



I've been working for more than a year as a team member on a group of projects related to forex and cryptocurrency market. Besides the routine duties of QA Automation - test analysis, test development and fixes, I was also involved in the development and improvement of the test framework, which covered the above projects.

I want to grow further in the profession, master new technologies and approaches in test automation and solve complex interesting testing tasks.

