# Resume

Sysadmin
Years of experience: 10
English level: pre

More than 12+ years experience in System Administrations and User Support;

More than 10 years Technical Support Engineer; 2+ years Lead position in User Support;

Implementing and maintaining MS Active Directory, DHCP, DNS, Group Policies, FireWalls;

Maintaining Asterisk telephony, VMware, Citrix;

Support: Windows/Windows Server OS family, Ms Office, Mobile device (iOS/Android);

Understanding of basic network services and protocols; Routers/Switches, Wireless AP configuration;
Projects	

Moving offices and connecting in a short time with a quick solution to related issues;

4 times moving a central office (40-60+ users) a short time with a quick solution to related issues (works with internet providers, related issues with building owners, constractions and installations organizations);

Transfer the servers to the data center, and makes the network connections with offices.

November 2010 - Today	System Administrator

TRIS Translation and Interpreting Center, Kyiv

Functions:	

•	Users support

•	New working space adjustment

•	Server support based on Windows 2003 Server (Active Directory, new uses grants providing)

•	Gateway setting based on Windows 2003 Server та ISA 2006 (DHCP,

DNS);

•	Gateway setting based on VPN L2TP/IPsec

•	Server setting based on Windows 2012 Server (Active Directory, new uses grants providing)

•	Virtual servers setting based on VMWare

•	Web-server   setting   based   on   Linux   (Debian):   corporate   site development based open CMS Drupal and Joomla

•	VPN gateway setting based on FreeBSD (DHCP, DNS, firewall (ip- firewall), VPN (Raccoon, MPD. OpenVPN), Samba, FTP

•	IP-telephony servers support based on Linux (Debian) and FreeBSD

•	Knowledge of Asterisk

•	Server and log monitoring with Nagios on Centos

•	Backup server setting based on Windows server 2003, Windows server 2008

•	Terminal server setting based on Windows server 2003, 2008, 2012
